  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to AOS projects for the survivors of typhoon Haiyan in the Philippines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Following Typhoon Haiyan in November 2013, the Pontifical Council for the Pastoral Care of Migrants and Itinerant People decided to set up a special fund to support survivors of the typhoon. The fund will support long-term reconstruction projects, to be realised in cooperation with AOS - Philippines, benefiting the people of the sea in affected areas when, after the initial weeks of emergency, people will have to return to their &quot;normal&quot; lives.</narrative>
  </description>
